#: rkward/plugins/analysis/ansari_bradley/ansari_bradley_test.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select two data sets for the Ansari-Bradley two-sample test. For this test "
"the samples need to be numeric vectors (see below for details)."
msgstr "Odaberite dva skupa podataka za Ansari-Bradleyjev test za dva uzorka. Uzorci za ovaj test moraju biti numerički vektori (pojedinosti su navedene u nastavku)."

