#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <summary>
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Calculate a correlation matrix given a number of numerical input vectors."
msgstr "Izračunava korelacijsku matricu na temelju zadanog broja numeričkih ulaznih vektora."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <usage>
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Choose the vectors to calculate correlations for. A correlation is "
"calculated for each pair of vectors. Optionally, (two-sided) p-values are "
"calculated for each pair."
msgstr "Odaberite vektore za koje želite izračunati korelacije. Korelacija se izračunava za svaki par vektora. Po želji se za svaki par izračunavaju (dvostrane) p-vrijednosti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "variable(s):")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:18
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the vectors to be correlated. For Pearson, Kendall and Spearman, the "
"vectors need to be numeric (see below), and of equal length. Polyserial "
"correlations are calculated between pairs of numeric and categorial "
"variables, and polychoric correlations between categorial variables. If the "
"categorial variables are dichotomous, polyserial/polychoric is equivalent to "
"biserial/tetrachoric correlations."
msgstr "Odaberite vektore za izračun korelacije. Za Pearsonovu, Kendallovu i Spearmanovu korelaciju vektori moraju biti numerički (pogledajte u nastavku) i jednake duljine. Poliserijske korelacije izračunavaju se između parova numeričkih i kategorijskih varijabli, a polihoričke između kategorijskih varijabli. Ako su kategorijske varijable dihotomne, poliserijska/polihorička korelacija jednaka je biserijskoj/tetrahorijskoj korelaciji."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Calculate p values")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:20
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked, an additional table with the (two-sided) significance values is "
"calculated and printed. For polyserial/polychoric correlations, Chi-squared "
"tests of bivariate normality are conducted, and also the standard errors are "
"reported."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, izračunava se i ispisuje dodatna tablica (dvostranih) vrijednosti značajnosti. Za poliserijske/polihoričke korelacije provode se hi-kvadrat testovi bivarijatne normalnosti, a navode se i standardne pogreške."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Method")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:21
#, kde-format
msgid "Method of correlation to be used."
msgstr "Metoda korelacije koju treba upotrijebiti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Treat ordered categorial variables as numeric ranks")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For Kendall and Spearman, if some variables are not numeric but ordered "
"categorial variables, have them treated as numeric ranks."
msgstr "Za Kendallovu i Spearmanovu korelaciju, ako neke varijable nisu numeričke, nego uređene kategorijske varijable, tretirajte ih kao numeričke rangove."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Correlation matrix) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Exclude missing values")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/corr_matrix.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In case of missing values, should be row be excluded from all calculation (i."
"e. even for those pairs of variables, where neither value is missing), or "
"should they only be excluded for those pairs where it is actually missing?"
msgstr "U slučaju nedostajućih vrijednosti, treba li redak isključiti iz svih izračuna (tj. čak i za one parove varijabli u kojima nijedna vrijednost ne nedostaje) ili ga treba isključiti samo za parove u kojima vrijednost doista nedostaje?"

