msgstr "Treba li provesti hi-kvadrat test (za svaki par)?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from N to 1 Crosstabulation) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Draw Barplot")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/crosstab.rkh:23
