#, kde-format
msgid "This test performs a chisquared test for detection of one outlier."
msgstr "Ovaj test provodi hi-kvadrat test radi otkrivanja jedne izdvojene vrijednosti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Chi-squared test for outlier) <usage>
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/outliers/chisq_out_test.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Choose the data set to find one outlier, based on chisquared distribution of "
"squared differences between data and sample mean. You can choose multiple "
"data. Please consider that this test is no longer recommended. See <link "
"href=\"rkward://rhelp/chisq.out.test\"/>."
msgstr "Odaberite skup podataka za pronalaženje jedne izdvojene vrijednosti na temelju hi-kvadrat distribucije kvadriranih razlika između podataka i uzoračke sredine. Možete odabrati više skupova podataka. Imajte na umu da se ovaj test više ne preporučuje. Pogledajte <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/chisq.out.test\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Chi-squared test for outlier) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "variable(s):")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/outliers/chisq_out_test.rkh:18
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the data to be computed. The vectors need to be numeric, and can be "
"of different length. For the calculation missing values are removed from the "
"data."
msgstr "Odaberite podatke za izračun. Vektori moraju biti numerički i mogu biti različite duljine. Nedostajuće se vrijednosti uklanjaju iz podataka prije izračuna."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Chi-squared test for outlier) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Opposite")
#: rkward/plugins/analysis/outliers/chisq_out_test.rkh:20
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check if you want not the value with largest difference from the mean, but "
"opposite (lowest, if most suspicious is highest etc.)."
msgstr "Označite ako ne želite vrijednost s najvećom razlikom od sredine, nego suprotnu (najmanju, ako je najsumnjivija najveća, itd.)."

